  "oracle_method": "Original raw demo inputs: main 1500000 + income/refund 2604000 - other flows 1815000 = 2289000; savings 150000; cash sum 2439000. No production calculator generates expected amounts. Service terms read raw JSON and frozen literally. Wrong object/time/source signatures are necessary structural rejection, not Chinese financial semantics certification.",
